		<title>Madonna Welcomes Rihanna to the Vita Coco Family</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://www.drownedmadonna.com/home/item/8-madonna-welcomes-rihanna-to-the-vita-coco-family.html"/>
		<published>2011-05-11T15:57:19Z</published>
		<updated>2011-05-11T15:57:19Z</updated>
		<id>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/home/item/8-madonna-welcomes-rihanna-to-the-vita-coco-family.html</id>
		<author>
			<name>Vincenzo Ruocco</name>
		</author>
		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.contactmusic.co.uk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;contact music&quot;&gt;contactmusic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Madonna has hired pop star Rihanna as the face of her coconut water drinks company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The pop legend is a leading investor in the Vita Coco brand, along with Red Hot Chili Peppers frontman Anthony Kiedis, and she has now asked the Umbrella hitmaker to be the face of the drink.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A statement from Madonna reads, &quot;Rihanna is a natural fit for the Vita Coco brand and I’m so happy to have her on the team, &quot; while Rihanna adds, &quot;I love Vita Coco. It’s real coconut water from hand-picked coconuts. It’s delicious and so good for you!”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</summary>
		<content type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;K2FeedIntroText&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.contactmusic.co.uk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;contact music&quot;&gt;contactmusic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Madonna has hired pop star Rihanna as the face of her coconut water drinks company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The pop legend is a leading investor in the Vita Coco brand, along with Red Hot Chili Peppers frontman Anthony Kiedis, and she has now asked the Umbrella hitmaker to be the face of the drink.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A statement from Madonna reads, &quot;Rihanna is a natural fit for the Vita Coco brand and I’m so happy to have her on the team, &quot; while Rihanna adds, &quot;I love Vita Coco. It’s real coconut water from hand-picked coconuts. It’s delicious and so good for you!”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</content>
